# Build QKMS™ Key Lifecycle, Rotation, and Risk Analysis Pages

## Objective

Create and implement the following QGuard Helix QKMS™ pages:

```txt
/dashboard/qkms/lifecycle
/dashboard/qkms/rotation
/dashboard/qkms/risk-analysis
```

These pages must extend the existing **QGuard Helix QKMS™** module and provide enterprise-grade key lifecycle management, cryptographic key rotation workflows, and key risk analysis.

All pages must use real tenant-scoped data from Supabase, QKMS inventory, cryptographic assets, certificates, workloads, identities, telemetry, and audit logs.

Do not use mock data, fake metrics, hardcoded key counts, placeholder risks, or simulated production results unless explicitly marked as demo mode.

